flowchart LR
 Client[Browser / external client] --> Router[HTTP route dispatcher]
 Router --> Auth[Authentication and authorization]
 Auth --> Controller[Controller adapter]
 Controller --> Service[Application/domain service]
 Service --> Data[(Relational persistence)]
 Controller --> Render[JSON / HTTP / rendered response]
 Provider[External provider] <--> Webhook[Webhook adapter]
 Webhook --> Service
